# Optional credentials and settings for the Regulated AI Deployment Kit.
#
# The local smoke path (scaffold tests, schema/grader unit tests, dataset
# inspection) MUST work without any of these set. Only fill these in when
# running Braintrust-backed evals or model-backed agent runs.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and edit. `.env` is gitignored.

# --- Braintrust (optional; enables remote tracing/eval persistence) ---
BRAINTRUST_API_KEY=
BRAINTRUST_PROJECT=regulated-agent-launch-kit

# --- Model providers (optional; only needed for live agent runs) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Default model selection for agent runs (optional) ---
# AGENT_MODEL_DEFAULT=
# AGENT_MODEL_HIGH_RISK=
